WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:39.860
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:45.180
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.640
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.830
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.740
In April of the same year, the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.690
...calling together mankind and Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:04.890
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.870
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:13.290
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:16.640
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.400
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.270
In September of 2030, the first of the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:28.390
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its
Megaroad predecessor, departed Earth.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.750
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:39.530
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from Earth orbit.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.330
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.910
It is now 2045...

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:15.330
First Contact

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.230
All right, all right, all right,
all right, all right !
First Contact

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:17.430
First Contact

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.550
All right, all right, all right.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.930
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ray.
I'm just about to take off...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.630
Take off where ?

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.780
M...Mom ?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.440
Now switch on the monitor !

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.710
Don't yell at
me like that.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.940
Well !
Just look at you !

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:36.370
Gimme a break. You're the one
who wanted the monitor on !

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.340
Mylene. Mylene !

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.340
Mylene, can't you do
something about this music ?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.120
I can't do everything at once.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:55.690
Mylene, if you really want to continue
being in a rock band, I'll let you.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.250
You mean it ?

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.730
I mean it.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.650
I can even provide your band
with some work, if you'd like.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:03.740
Really ?

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.580
Yes, really.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.970
All right !
I love you !

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.760
But, there's one condition.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.780
It figures.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.080
Take a look at this.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.120
Who's this ?

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:25.130
He's Unified Forces ace pilot,
Lt Gamlin Kizaki of Diamond Force.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:28.580
I know mom, you want
me to assassinate him, right ?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.230
Right. With an arrow
through his heart.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:36.850
( Omiai - Possible engagement meeting )
Mylene, I want to arrange
things between you and Gamlin.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.330
Arrange things ?!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:51.430
Nekki Basara's just
a civilian, after all.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:55.250
So why does he have
the latest model VF-19 ?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.660
Protection level 12 ?!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.830
I should at least be able to get the
date of manufacture and serial number.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:08.930
Warning ! In accordance regulation 1345,
any further access inquiries...

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.330
...will result in the erasure
of data on this terminal.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:15.920
Why ? I just want to find out
basic data about his Valkyrie !

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.940
Access denied !
Access denied !

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:28.730
Nekki Basara ! I'll find out
who you are, no matter what !

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.930
Be back home at
2 pm tomorrow, no matter what.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.990
Mom, I'm not interested
in this at all.

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:40.260
In the first place, aren't I a little
young for an arranged marriage ?

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:44.900
Aren't you the one who's always
asking not to be treated like a child ?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.760
Well that's
completely different !

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.930
Got it. Tomorrow at 2 pm.
I'll be waiting, Mylene.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.730
Wait a minute !

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:58.180
Oh yes. I sent the dress you'll be wearing
tomorrow. It should arrive pretty soon.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.290
See ya !

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.260
Geez ! What's with her ?!

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.530
Mom's always...

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.720
I'll be late
for the concert !

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.440
I'm sorry !  I'm in a hurry,
so just toss it inside !

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:28.330
When I'm lost in a strong rain...

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:39.530
...I'll play the guitar
and calm myself down.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:41.750
Come on, people.
I want you to feel this.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.520
Basara, slide number 52.
Come on, people.
I want you to feel this.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.630
What, 52 ?
Come on, people.
I want you to feel this.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.530
Come on, people.
I want you to feel this.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:55.320
Hey.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.490
Ray.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.770
We're about to meet up with Mylene.
That just leaves you.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:04.130
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:07.180
That's good.
Get here soon.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.330
Right.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:15.420
The output has been increased 20%,
but I think controlling it will be difficult.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.550
No problem.
I'm used to breaking wild horses.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:22.070
Lieutenant Kinryu, the Captain has
given authorization for test flights.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.830
Let's take them out gently.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.230
Roger !

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.890
That was gently ?!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.310
Diamond Force is impressive !

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:40.930
...cross a heart with another.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:47.380
My heart of love soars into the night sky,
carrying my burning emotions.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:52.330
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:59.780
A heart of love is inside you too.
Face your destiny.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:07.080
It can go billions of light years ahead.
My charging heart of love.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:16.780
D2 to D1. Can you see the
civilian craft on Milky Road 77 ?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.570
I see it.
What's the problem, Gamlin ?

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:22.430
It appears to be the
latest model MM shuttle...

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:25.030
...but the maximum speed and
thruster output are abnormal.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.160
Maybe they modified
it on their own.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:34.430
Physica, remember that a good pilot won't
overlook even the smallest possibility.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:37.470
All right. Do a data
analysis on the computer.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.430
Roger.

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.730
Well ?

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:45.730
Just as I thought.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.860
I'll send the data.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:52.680
If it's an MM-15D,
there should be no problem.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:58.520
What ?  MM-18 ?  17 ?  15 ?
What the hell ?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:06.830
It's a clever disguise. It's either a military
spy craft, a civilian prototype, or...

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.910
An enemy infiltrator !

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.340
It's possible.

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.930
Commander, allow me to
continue pursuit.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:14.910
All right, do it.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:21.470
Physica, we'll go back and evaluate
the results of the test flight.

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:22.200
Roger.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:38.730
D-2 to D-1. Unregistered civilian
vessel has been lost.

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:42.690
Permission requested
to continue pursuit.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:47.720
This is D-1. Further pursuit would
be out of the range of our duties.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.730
Return to ship.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.080
But Commander...

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.330
We'll send an
investigative party.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.980
Return to the ship and prepare to
enjoy your vacation starting tomorrow.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:10:00.600
Commander, officially, my vacation
starts today at 1900 hours.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.230
That means that my
vacation starts in one hour.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.840
So ?

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:08.220
Let me continue the investigation
during my free time.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.390
Still...

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:13.100
I will let the investigation team
take over as soon as they arrive.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:15.250
If I could just
continue until then...

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.300
All right.
I'll permit it.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.470
You're such
a workaholic.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:20.730
Thank you.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.140
Captain, what do
you make of this ?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.670
It's all right, I suppose.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.140
This is D-2.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.340
It seems I've
lost the ship.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.930
Please request that the investigation
team search the surrounding airspace.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:52.330
Roger.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.810
I guess I'll head back.

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.530
No mistaking it !

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.500
It's his Valkyrie !

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.730
That means Nekki Basara
is on this ship.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:10.280
This is D-2, Gamlin.
As of now I am off duty.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.290
Would you like
a pamphlet ?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.100
Sure.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:13.870
