00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:24.830
Basara, what's up
with you today ?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.980
What do you mean ?

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:29.620
It's unlike you to miss
your cue like you did.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:30.760
Really ?

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:40.730
Yeah, you weren't as
impressive as usual, Basara.

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:41.880
Oh, yeah ?

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.630
Hey, we're concerned
about you !

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.690
Thanks.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:49.330
Excuse me. Is this seat open ?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:50.440
I guess.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.350
