00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.620
What are you
talking about ?

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:49.060
It seems like the
guy behind us is a fan.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.570
Why don't you give
him your autograph ?

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:02.750
Ultra Rave.
It sounds nice.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.730
Not bad.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.240
