00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.460
Why you ?!

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:47.590
Sorry we're late, Gamlin !

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:49.880
Commander.

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:53.940
Damn. I'll retreat today,
but you won't get away next time.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.270
Damn. I guess
I owe him one.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.450
Well, it can't be helped.
Recover from your injuries soon.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.550
We'll have to do it another time.

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.460
Right.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:24.830
Come in.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:29.880
You are ?

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:34.080
Nice to meet you,
I'm Mylene Jenius.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.580
What can I do for you ?

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:40.830
Mom's...I mean, I heard that you
couldn't come to the mayor's house.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.330
Mylene...
Oh, the mayor's daughter.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.520
You'll have
to excuse me.

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:50.100
I was on
the Mark Twain.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:54.620
I saw how
brave you are.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:58.830
So I thought I would come
and see how you were doing.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.690
I'll put the
flowers in a vase.

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:08.730
What is it ?

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:13.730
Why...why was a person like
you on a ship like that ?

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:18.820
I was doing research
for a class at school.

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:23.130
Oh, I see. You must have
a lot of work at school.

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:28.480
This has turned out to be a strange
way to make your acquaintance.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:30.720
Yeah, really.

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

